Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.35,0:00:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The payday was somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.79,0:00:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,else's rent. Lucia recognized
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the envelopes in Jason's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,suitcase before he opened
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.11,0:00:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,one. Room numbers. Cash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.47,0:00:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,folded around rent receipts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.39,0:00:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody had emptied the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,office safe during the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.55,0:00:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,storm. Their buyer had
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,called it stolen gambling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.59,0:00:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,money. The suitcase told
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,a much cheaper, uglier
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.87,0:00:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,story. Jason counted enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.03,0:00:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,to clear their debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.47,0:00:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucia counted seven families
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,paying for the same
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.51,0:00:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,rooms twice.\NOutside, headlights
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.91,0:00:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,swept the curtains. Their
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.59,0:00:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,buyer had arrived early,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,expecting a suitcase and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,no questions. Lucia pushed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.27,0:00:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the envelopes through the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.43,0:00:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,locked office's rent slot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Every room number stayed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,with its money. They
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,left the empty suitcase
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.71,0:00:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,beside the buyer's parked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.07,0:00:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,car, then walked out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,through the\Nlaundry courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.71,0:00:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,By morning, their debt
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,was still waiting. For
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,once, seven other people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,would not be waiting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.79,0:00:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,outside.
